WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Demand rises 40%. The planner needs a response before replenishment.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
42 units available. 79 needed over seven days. A 37-unit gap.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Keep 35 units for donor demand. Check arrival, capacity and cost.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
The planner checks commitments and approves a simulated 37-unit transfer.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
The planned transfer covers the simulated gap. Track real outcomes in a pilot.

